(668, 'Michael Cooper', 'cooper.jannette75@googlemail.com', 'Hi there,\r\n\r\nI was reviewing your website, not sure how many employees you have, but this might be a great way to encourage your team while helping them improve their health at the same time.\r\n\r\nWe created the EleRing fitness tracker, now available at 50% off, just $59 instead of $120. \r\n\r\nThe EleRIng is a powerful, all-day wearable fitness tracker worn on the finger. It helps people stay on top of their health, energy, and daily activity—without changing their routine.\r\n\r\nInterested in learning more, Visit us here: https://elebands.odoo.com\r\n\r\nEmployees can use EleRing to:\r\n\r\n- Track health data throughout the day\r\n- Improve fitness and daily activity\r\n- Support weight loss goals\r\n- Better understand sleep and recovery\r\n\r\nJust imagine how happy your team would be to receive an EleRing. We’ve found people value tools like this far more than typical swag—because they actually use it every day.\r\n\r\nReady to try the EleRing for yourself? Visit us here: https://elebands.odoo.com \r\n\r\nBest,\r\n\r\nMichael', '2026-04-05 06:32:40', '2026-04-05 06:32:40'),
(669, 'Marty Glenny', 'ezra.glenny@msn.com', 'Hello,\r\n\r\nMy name is Marty.\r\n\r\nI have a quick question for whoever handles employee benefits at your company.\r\n\r\nUnder the Affordable Care Act and Mental Health Parity rules, employers may be asked to verify that they provide adequate mental health access for employees starting January 1, 2026.\r\n\r\nThere is a government-approved program that helps meet these requirements while potentially saving your company up to $639 per employee per year and reducing workers’ compensation costs by up to 18%.\r\n\r\nThe program works alongside your current health plan, helps protect you in case of a mental health parity audit, and has a zero net cost to the company.\r\n\r\nEmployees and up to six family members may receive benefits such as:\r\n\r\n- Unlimited mental health services\r\n- 24/7 virtual and urgent care doctors\r\n- 1,000 free maintenance medications via online pharmacy\r\n- Weight management and healthy living support\r\n\r\nWe created a 1-minute survey to see if your company may qualify.\r\n\r\nYou can take the survey here: https://www.essentialbenefitspros.com\r\n\r\nIf I reached the wrong person, I would appreciate it if you could forward this to whoever handles employee benefits or your CFO.\r\n\r\nKindly,\r\n\r\nMarty T.', '2026-04-05 12:45:10', '2026-04-05 12:45:10'),
